        "家庭作业题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "550",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作乘法：",
        "1) $(-3)\\cdot(-15)\\cdot(-20)\\cdot(-4)$；",
        "2) $(-12)\\cdot(-5)\\cdot(-10)\\cdot5$；",
        "3) $(-7)\\cdot(-1.2)\\cdot(-5)$；",
        "4) $(-12.5)\\cdot2.4\\cdot(-8)\\cdot(-5)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "551",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "以$<$或$>$号代替星号，使成真不等式：",
        "1) $(-16)\\cdot1253\\cdot(-8)\\cdot(-4)\\cdot(-3)*0$；",
        "2) $13\\cdot(-24)\\cdot(-15)\\cdot(-8)\\cdot4*0$；",
        "3) $64\\cdot(-3)\\cdot(-2)\\cdot3\\cdot244*0$；",
        "4) $37\\cdot(-4)\\cdot(-5)\\cdot(-2)\\cdot(-3)*0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "552",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "作长方形$ABCD$，使$|AB|=6$厘米，$|BC|=3$厘米.再作",
        "长方形$ABCD$的关于直线$AB$的对称图形.所作的这两",
        "个对称图形的并集是什么图形？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "553",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "汽艇顺流航行59.2公里，逆流航行87.5公里.假设汽",
        "艇的速度是27.3公里/小时，流速2.3公里/小时，汽艇",
        "航行全程共用了多少时间？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "554",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下式的值：",
        "1) $(8.74+0.66:13.2-3.79)\\cdot0.31$；",
        "2) $(9.68-0.77:15.4+0.87)\\cdot0.42$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
